- DO NOT use greedy heuristics — they fail on w=[10,20,30], v=[60,100,120], cap=50 (optimum=220, greedy=160).
- Selection invariants: sum(selected.zip(weights).map(p => p._1 * p._2)) ≤ capacity; sum of selected values = maxValue.
